{"product_id":"man-magnet-how-to-be-the-best-woman-you-can-be-in-order-to-get-the-best-man","title":"Man Magnet: How to Be the Best Woman You Can Be in Order to Get the Best Man","description":"\u003cp\u003eMost women, generally speaking, don't have much trouble attracting men. The problem is the men they're attracting. Some are bum magnets. And others are pest magnets. But there is a special breed of woman who attracts just about any guy she wants. She is a Man Magnet and she can get any guy she wants. This book will show you that you can be one too. You can be that woman that guys go ga-ga for. All you have to is utilize what you've got. Man Magnet-How to Be the Best Woman You Can Be in Order to Get the Best Man can help you do just that. Ready to be unstoppable?\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Romy Miller\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781932420456\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat:  Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 156\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 126 x 202\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750283911321,"sku":"1RA9781932420456","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/man-magnet-how-to-be-the-best-woman-you-can-be-in-order-to-get-the-best-man-934577.jpg?v=1694790843","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/man-magnet-how-to-be-the-best-woman-you-can-be-in-order-to-get-the-best-man","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}